<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The rental line comes first</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">The verified monthly rates</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">The operating layer</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">The settling-in layer</a></li>
